_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-11-19T16:03:12Z","updated_at":"2025-11-20T02:01:06Z","closed_at":"2025-11-20T01:58:43Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.6.dev4.official [bd2ca13c6] \n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.dev4 - Bazzite 43.20251114.0 (Kinoite) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 3 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6600 (RADV NAVI23) - AMD Ryzen 3 3200G with Radeon Vega Graphics (4 threads) - 29.31 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nI'm testing out the new IK system and I'm quite impressed with the work that's gone into it.  One thing that stands out, however, is that unlike other IK Systems I've used (including Godot's own SkeletonIK3D), the new IK system's End Bone ignores target rotation completely. If I'm trying to pose a character or accurately finesse a target's rotation, I can't do that unless I add a BoneAttachment3D to each end bone.  This works, but it can result in limb stretching, added scene clutter, and generally feels like a workaround.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/80f9c4f7-e44f-48d0-ae04-c1b9ba278336)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/13970fd6-8b33-4928-9f8c-7ad263ad59ec)\n\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nDownload the MRP.\nOpen the default scene and explore the options.\nNotice that when you hit \"Play IK\" on the Skeleton IK 3D, the End Bone matches the target rotation.\n\nCompare that with \"Marker Hand Right\" on other IK Models.\n\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[IK Test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23632438/IK.Test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112964/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112964/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}